  "notes": "Tunisia’s national heritage institute identifies the former White Fathers seminary as the museum. The 2022 conservation programme gives a highest seminary elevation of 73.29 m above national datum and distinguishes the seminary from the cathedral. The exact public-domain 2008 Qualla courtyard photograph supplies the white arcade, piano nobile, rhythm and planted court enclosure."
